1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:02,760
This is BlockID Business Passport:

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,745
know the business you invest in.

3
00:00:04,745 --> 00:00:07,276
A live, checked view of the business you own,

4
00:00:07,276 --> 00:00:09,245
with dividends paid to your wallet.

5
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:13,832
Today, investors lose sight of a business once they invest.

6
00:00:13,832 --> 00:00:15,567
The numbers are hard to trust,

7
00:00:15,567 --> 00:00:18,749
ownership sits in spreadsheets, and dividends are slow,

8
00:00:18,749 --> 00:00:19,559
or never come.

9
00:00:20,522 --> 00:00:21,986
The need is large.

10
00:00:21,986 --> 00:00:25,445
Alternative assets are heading to thirty-two trillion dollars by 2030,

11
00:00:25,445 --> 00:00:29,200
and venture investors put in four hundred and twenty-five billion last year.

12
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:33,603
Yet in 2024, private equity paid back just eleven percent of its

13
00:00:33,603 --> 00:00:35,117
value, a ten-year low.

14
00:00:36,062 --> 00:00:38,550
Here is the live app, on testnet.

15
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:42,605
No sign-up: a demo investor sees each holding at the latest approved

16
00:00:42,605 --> 00:00:44,871
price, and the dividends already paid.

17
00:00:45,818 --> 00:00:47,612
Each holding shows your stake,

18
00:00:47,612 --> 00:00:49,943
a price that moves only after approval,

19
00:00:49,943 --> 00:00:51,079
and shared updates.

20
00:00:52,046 --> 00:00:54,474
To check a business, paste its website.

21
00:00:54,474 --> 00:00:58,450
AI agents read it, find competitors and analyse the market.

22
00:00:58,450 --> 00:01:00,034
They hold no keys.

23
00:01:00,034 --> 00:01:01,700
They only propose.

24
00:01:02,666 --> 00:01:05,308
You get a grade, a score and a value range,

25
00:01:05,308 --> 00:01:07,582
and every figure links to its source.

26
00:01:08,534 --> 00:01:10,417
A person approves every step,

27
00:01:10,417 --> 00:01:12,105
signed by an admin wallet.

28
00:01:12,105 --> 00:01:14,153
Only then does the issuer act.

29
00:01:15,098 --> 00:01:17,604
The share register lives on BlockID chain,

30
00:01:17,604 --> 00:01:19,931
mirrored to Ethereum and HashKey Chain.

31
00:01:20,894 --> 00:01:24,036
Businesses open offerings with the dilution shown first,

32
00:01:24,036 --> 00:01:26,560
and dividends reach every wallet with no gas.

33
00:01:27,530 --> 00:01:28,803
Don't trust us.

34
00:01:28,803 --> 00:01:31,994
Your browser checks the report against three blockchains.

35
00:01:31,994 --> 00:01:34,565
Change one number, and it turns red.

36
00:01:35,510 --> 00:01:37,260
What does each side get?

37
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,964
Investors get a checked value,

38
00:01:38,964 --> 00:01:40,838
the same update at the same time,

39
00:01:40,838 --> 00:01:43,224
proof of ownership, and dividends on time.

40
00:01:43,224 --> 00:01:46,150
In return, the business keeps a live share register,

41
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:48,908
as Australian and Vietnamese law already require,

42
00:01:48,908 --> 00:01:53,129
reports on schedule, and has a person approve every new share and dividend.

43
00:01:54,098 --> 00:01:56,800
This also prepares for tokenised assets.

44
00:01:56,800 --> 00:02:01,137
On-chain real-world assets grew from about seven to thirty-nine billion dollars in

45
00:02:01,137 --> 00:02:04,681
nineteen months, and Citi expects five and a half trillion by 2030.

46
00:02:04,681 --> 00:02:07,062
New rules demand proper custody.

47
00:02:07,062 --> 00:02:10,223
In BlockID, keys sit only in an isolated issuer,

48
00:02:10,223 --> 00:02:14,371
every holder is verified, and a licensed custodian can plug in.

49
00:02:15,326 --> 00:02:19,261
On HashKey Chain, AgentProvenance records which agent proposed,

50
00:02:19,261 --> 00:02:20,885
and which person approved.

51
00:02:21,842 --> 00:02:24,132
BlockID HR checks the founding team:

52
00:02:24,132 --> 00:02:27,377
each requirement against public sources and the CV.

53
00:02:28,334 --> 00:02:30,510
Today the full flow runs on testnet:

54
00:02:30,510 --> 00:02:34,620
fourteen sample listings, forty-two token contracts on three chains,

55
00:02:34,620 --> 00:02:37,703
every report verified, and over five hundred tests.

56
00:02:37,703 --> 00:02:39,453
No real users yet.

57
00:02:40,418 --> 00:02:43,503
Next: pilot businesses in Australia and Vietnam,

58
00:02:43,503 --> 00:02:46,846
investor communities, and licensed custody partners.

59
00:02:46,846 --> 00:02:48,275
Agents propose.

60
00:02:48,275 --> 00:02:49,582
Humans approve.

61
00:02:49,582 --> 00:02:50,941
Chains prove.

62
00:02:50,941 --> 00:02:53,572
Try it at eth dot blockid dot au.
